<h1>Amex to Aeroplan Transfer Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Calculate exact Air Canada Aeroplan® points received from American Express Membership Rewards® points. Real-time 1:1 transfer calculator, 1,000-point increment enforcement, and Star Alliance redemption analysis.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  <strong>Direct Answer:</strong> American Express Membership Rewards® transfer to Air Canada Aeroplan® at a <strong>1:1 ratio in increments of 1,000 points</strong> (1,000 Amex points = 1,000 Aeroplan points). Because Air Canada is a foreign carrier, Amex charges <strong>$0 in excise offset fees</strong>. Transfers typically process instantly and are strictly non-reversible.
</div>

